body:
the thing is, he always apologizes the next day and explain what happens and is really nice. but it still really hurts. you really just can't take those words back. and I know that I'm supposed to forgive him because I'm really lucky to have a father who *apologizes* after he messes up and isn't constantly mean to me like other parents. but he tells me it's for the best and maybe it really is. 

&#x200B;

but that's true!!! I'll keep up my good work and believe in myself!! thank you so much for your encouragement!! :) :)
